<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar for home usually means one package: a hybrid inverter, a battery bank and rooftop panels, wired to your distribution board so the house can run from panels and battery before it falls back on the NEPA line or the gen. The work is done by an independent installer, not by this site, and a sound job starts with a load audit of what you actually run: fridge, freezer, fans, TV, pumping machine and, in some homes, AC.</p><p>Published price guides cover home systems from 1 kVA up to about 10 kVA, and the right size follows your appliances, not the size of your house. This page covers how sizing is done, what a complete package lists, roof mounting and changeover wiring, and how to compare quotes. Call now on +234 809 000 0000 and describe your appliances, and you will be pointed to an independent installer who can quote.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Load audit first</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Sizing starts from the rating plates on your fridge, freezer, fans, TV, pumping machine and AC, not from a rule of thumb.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Hybrid inverter, 1.5 to 11 kVA</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Mercury Direct's listings run from 1.5 kVA up to 11 kVA. The kW figure on the inverter datasheet is what it can actually carry.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Battery bank sized in kWh</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Mercury Direct's lithium packages run from 5 kWh to 15 kWh; tubular banks are quoted by the number of 220Ah batteries. Chemistry and capacity must be on the quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Rooftop mounting</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Panels sit on mounts fixed to your roof structure. On aluminium or long-span roofs, ask what the mounts fix to before the job starts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Changeover or ATS at the DB</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Chosen circuits move between light, inverter and gen through a changeover or ATS, with isolators, breakers, surge protection and earthing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Quotes that name models</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Two or three comparable written quotes, each listing the exact inverter, battery and panel models, is how you avoid paying for a swap.</p>
      </div>
</div>
